# docs/EFFORT-LOG.md is an append-only ledger that every seat writes to, so it conflicts on
# almost every PR.  Resolving those by hand is how a seat silently drops another seat's
# rows, which is exactly what happened on 2026-10-04 when the file went from 716 rows to 9.
#
# merge=union takes both sides and concatenates them, so the union a careful agent would
# have written by hand is what git does automatically.  A duplicate row is harmless and visible;
# a missing row is not.
docs/EFFORT-LOG.md merge=union
public/tv-face/skins/blue/stills/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
